{"seq":3,"slug":"a-classic-text","title":"千古奇书","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/major-works/a-classic-text","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conciseness-and-depth","title":"言简意赅的奇书","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/major-works/a-classic-text/conciseness-and-depth","wordCount":1662,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-philosophical-masterpiece","title":"蕴含哲理的杰作","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/major-works/a-classic-text/a-philosophical-masterpiece","wordCount":1550,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"千古奇书\">千古奇书</h1><p>本章呈现《孙子兵法》作为千古奇书的品质。这部著作，以极为精炼的篇幅，承载了极为深刻的智慧，是一部言简意赅的奇书；它更蕴含着深刻的哲理，是一部超越军事的哲理杰作。两篇文档，分别呈现言简意赅的奇书，以及蕴含哲理的杰作。</p>\n"}